put.gd Proton Drive helper: where its source is

The corresponding source of putgd-proton-runtime (Proton's Drive SDK and crypto,
OpenPGP.js, Bun with JavaScriptCore and TinyCC) and the rebuild instructions are
published with this put.gd release at

@PUTGD_SOURCE_URL@

as putgd-proton-corresponding-source.tar.gz.part1 and .part2 (concatenate them in
order) and proton-source-catalog.json, a copy of SOURCES.json beside this file,
which lists every source packet by SHA-256. put.gd's own source is
putgd-VERSION-source.tar.gz on the same page.
